# pc-shield-power: c is master, aa its A/A copy, sc SHIELD-22 (the rival's cheapest wide-enough crossing power),
# sr SHIELD-23 (crossing power capped at the enemy's bullet times the energy ratio).
# Both act only while shield mode is on, so only shielded robots can move.
c | hadur117.Hadur 3.21 | bisect/hadur117.Hadur_3.21.jar
aa | hadur117.Hadur 3.21aa | bisect/hadur117.Hadur_3.21aa.jar
sc | hadur117.Hadur 3.21sc | bisect/hadur117.Hadur_3.21sc.jar
sr | hadur117.Hadur 3.21sr | bisect/hadur117.Hadur_3.21sr.jar
